/*
  The help center's content (/help, help.js). Every guide is in English and Hebrew.
  - shot: a picture from the game in /site/help/shots/<shot>.jpg
  - marks: numbered marks on the picture. { i: n } = the n-th place measured when the picture was taken
    (/site/help/shots/marks.json), or { r: [x, y, w, h] } as parts of the picture (0-1). en/he = what it is.
  - kw: more words people may search with (any language). SYN: words that mean the same thing.
*/
